1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,588
This check is for ten thousand dollars.

2
00:00:03,588 --> 00:00:05,300
And it's dated 1956.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,680
An old man in Montana handed
it to me in an envelope.

4
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,050
All he asked for was a ride.

5
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:14,330
To the house he grew up in.

6
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:16,763
Hours of empty road.

7
00:00:16,763 --> 00:00:18,670
He barely said a word.

8
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:22,670
He just watched the fields go
by, like he was counting them.

9
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:26,490
When we got there, he pressed
the envelope into my hand.

10
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:28,680
Full story's on the channel.

11
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:30,840
But the date on that check...
